    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32105" root="غفر" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَغَفِرُ القَفَا</span></b>  means <i>He is one who has</i> [<i>hair such
as is termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَفَر</span> <i>upon the back of his neck:</i> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِىَ غَفِرَةُ الوَجْهِ</span>, <i>she is one who has</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَفَر</span> <i>upon her
face.</i> (AHn, K, * TA.)

